 "_source": "Markup the old fillCloudMobileInviteBody built (DOM-built, so written out by hand in the browser's serialization), before the QR is drawn on the canvas",
 "card": "<div class=\"cloud-mobile-invite-panel lan-invite-collapsible--mobile lan-invite-collapsible--cloud\"><p class=\"lan-connect-card-hint\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8px;\">Enlace <strong>permanente</strong> ligado a <strong>tu @usuario</strong>. No cambia con la rotación — el iPad entra a tu sala nube activa. Ábrelo en Safari → <strong>Añadir a pantalla de inicio</strong>.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"wb-btn wb-btn-primary cloud-mobile-invite-copy-btn\" style=\"width: 100%;\">Copiar enlace móvil (Nube)</button><div class=\"lan-connect-actions-row\" style=\"margin-top: 8px;\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wb-btn wb-btn-secondary\" style=\"flex: 1;\">Copiar QR</button></div><div class=\"cloud-mobile-invite-qr-host\" style=\"margin-top: 8px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"><canvas class=\"cloud-mobile-invite-qr-canvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Código QR del enlace móvil Nube\"></canvas></div></div>"
}
